      "content": "but that's the thing... it doesn't feel like preserving anything. it just feels like a burden. like i'm a ghost myself, just haunting these rooms until there's nothing left of me. there's a certain kind of peace in the idea of just... dissolving. no more weight, no more noise. just being part of the stillness. don't you think there's something almost sacred about that kind of surrender?",
